  "bodyText": "Skip to content\n\nFree shipping on orders $150+\n\nShop\nMagazine\nAbout\nCart\nSkip to product information\nOpen media 1 in modal\nOpen media 2 in modal\nOpen media 3 in modal\nOpen media 4 in modal\nOpen media 5 in modal\nPatchwork Cardi\nRegular price\n$295.00 CAD\nSize\nS\nM\nL\nColor\nPurple\nBlue\nGrey\nBrown\nQuantity\nDecrease quantity for Patchwork Cardi\nIncrease quantity for Patchwork Cardi\nAdd to cart\n\nA patchwork intarsia cardigan with intricate cable detailing.\n\nThis cardigan is fully fashioned and hand-linked by highly skilled craftspeople at our purpose-built factory in Wigston, Leicestershire. \n\n\nIt’s knitted with our trademark Supersoft lambswool and finished with sustainably sourced corozo nut buttons.\n\nSize chart\nLook after your garms\nOur knitwear is made from 100% lambswool.\nLambswool is a natural fiber with anti-bacterial self cleaning properties.\nIt should be washed less frequently than the rest of your wardrobe.\nWe recommend airing your garment and spot cleaning where appropriate. When it comes time, wash by hand at 30ºC/85ºF and dry on a flat surface.\nHave a favorite color? We've put all the pieces you'll like in one place.\nMulticolor \nMostly red \nMostly blue \nMostly yellow \nWe’re not mind readers, but we think you’ll like these too.\nShipping is free for orders of $150+, and we have flat rates below that.\nContiguous US — $12.95\nEverywhere else — $25.00\nStay in the know\nEmail\n\nFollow us on social media\n\nTwitter\nFacebook\nInstagram\nTikTok\nYouTube\nThis is a demonstration store. You can purchase products like this from Country of Origin. © 2026 Powered by Shopify"
}